<ProseLayout
  title="Ironman 70.3 Kraichgau."
  description="6:52:07 against a 5:30 plan. Both legs cramped 400 m into the swim and never released. Four times I nearly stopped — and none of the four were about the pain."
  kicker="WRITING · SPORT"
  metaLine="JUN 2026 · 7 MIN"
>
  <p>31 May 2026. 1.9 km swim, 90 km bike, 21.1 km run. I was 21.</p>

  <p>The plan was 5:30. Forty minutes for the swim, revised to forty-five once my shoulder became a factor. 3:05 on the bike. 1:30 for the half marathon.</p>

